  THE FACTORED LEAD IS REFUSED. The cleanest four-context table this
  creature can make is NOT additive in its two features: the interaction
  share is 0.325 against a chance of 0.333, only 1.4 SE below it. A
  factored parameterisation would discard about as much as it keeps, so
  parameters per FEATURE cannot replace parameters per CONTEXT here.
